---

At night you may see a column of light in the distance. That is a leyline pillar. Walk to it. Charge it. It can tear open a **Leyline Rift**.

A rift is waves. Clear them, collapse the rift, take the loot. Theme drops, a pile of XP, and a chance at a **Ley Crystal** if you are lucky. Different charged pillars open different rifts: amethyst mess, void tear, noisy echo. You will learn which silhouette is worth the walk.

This is the school’s world content. If you only craft the staff and never leave the base at night, you are playing half the mod.

Pack authors: pillars are the “go outside” hook. Pair them with a quest that says “charge a pillar” and people will actually find the rifts. Do not hide the Ley Crystal behind a shop if the rift already drops it. Let the night loop pay for itself.
